				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														small info <br />
 next  time  cleric  get  online 1 hour  befor  every  one  start  moving  over cleric  buff  those who  get there  when  buffed  log off. you  still will have buff when you  start raid  and cleric  will have full  manna.<br />
every  group  need  1 cleric  to be  sure every  one  get  heals  . I Sugest  even  that  we keep  easy  raids  still  every one knows  there  part  in the  group  .I  I also  would  like to keep  the same groups  for raids  so  every  can start working  better  that way  becourse  not  al  people have  the  same  NEEDS .The  raid  was  realy  fun we  got i  few  30 plus  lvl  in guild  .mabey  befor  next  raid  i group  off  lvl 30 plus  can  check  out  the  place and  find  out  good  place  our  spots  to  camp .<br />
Next RAID  SUGESTION   UPPER  GUK  i few  paladins  can  use  i Ghoul Bane .From what  i have  found  the  place is  from  15 till 25 plus .I other  place  we can  try  is  in rath  moution  to  kill  Hill  giants  the  give  like  50 pp   ans  i know  people  that  can use  the  money  . I  also  sugest  that  we  make  som  guild  tresere  for  those  that  are  i few PP  short  to  buy  i nice  item  our  spels  afcourse  the have  to pay it  back.						</td>
